# A7 — Cloudflare Tunnel connector token. Installs to
# /etc/ami-trade-tunnel.env (root-owned, mode 0600).
#
# Never paste the real token into THIS file (it lives in git). The systemd
# unit reads /etc/ami-trade-tunnel.env at runtime.
#
# Token rotation:
#   1. CF dashboard → Networks → Tunnels → ami-trade → Configure → "Rotate token"
#   2. sudo $EDITOR /etc/ami-trade-tunnel.env   # paste new token
#   3. sudo systemctl restart ami-trade-tunnel
#   4. CF dashboard shows the new connector ID; the old one stops
#      registering and ages out.

CF_TUNNEL_TOKEN=
